      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُتَّى</span></b>  A woman <i>who changes, in pronunciation,</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">س</span> <i>into</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ر</span> <i>into</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غ</span> <i>or</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ل</span>, <i>and the like;</i> or
<i>who changes one letter into another;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَثْغَآءُ</span>.
(AA, T, K.) [See also what follows.]


